title: January 2027

@election_year_opens_2027
# prose-audit: Grade B — The three closing arguments are distinct and each has an authored result, but the premise is three lines of scene-setting for the decisive year: no leader, no poll, no organiser, nothing of the eight years the choice is supposed to be about.
title: The election year opens
subtitle: Decide which part of eight years of political memory should define Lewica's last campaign.
face-image: img/poland/events/election-2023-ballot.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
